{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：22:50 2026-11-25 HKT<br/>發佈時間：22:50 2026-11-25 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：22:50 2026-11-25 HKT</p><img alt=\"艾道拿今晚終勝出「頌星」破悶局。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl_square/346738912e1ca8e52709d2f4944474c3/2026-11/m1_9.jpg\"/><p>艾道拿自上月廿八日贏「致力之城」後，近一個月未勝，今晚終憑賀廄「頌星」破悶局，此馬上兩仗配騎者獲亞，今戰終於坐正，賀賢另贏「飛躍成就」起孖。「頌星」馬主團體經理人蒙德揚表示，因五班千四賽程少，賀賢讓牠跑谷草一哩，結果順利奏捷。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T15:43:56.309399+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":196,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T14:50:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T19:48:15.188390+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T15:37:20.372861+00:00","content_hash":"b45b7709f957b98d9bda7e19c6c3263687a0e163d37856481b8d1a70dcc67509","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}